          <p>Find your exact FRA date by birth year and see how early claiming affects your benefit.</p>
          <span class="surv-related-btn">Use This Free Tool</span>
          <span class="surv-no-acct">No account needed</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- INTERNAL LINKS SECTION -->
  <div class="surv-internal-links">
    <p>
      For complete guidance on widow and survivor benefits, visit our <a href="/social-security/">Social Security education hub</a> — and explore our in-depth guides on <a href="/tools/social-security-spousal-benefit-calculator/">calculating spousal benefits</a>, evaluating your <a href="/tools/social-security-full-retirement-age-calculator/">Full Retirement Age schedule</a>, or modeling early filing using our <a href="/tools/social-security-break-even-calculator/">break-even calculator</a>.
